  "gameDescriptionHtml": "\n<p>Chorus of Carcosa is a first-person psychological horror game about an anxious sculptor who is trapped in a dark and ever-changing building. Stay silent, survive its twisted labyrinths and escape the monsters. Just don’t lose your way in the shadows or within your own mind.</p>\n<p><b>Game Features</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Experience the fear of facing the unknown – Survive an ever-changing decrepit apartment building filled with dangers and mysteries… Without making a sound! Or THEY will hear you…\n</li><li>Solve the mystery of an alternate reality – A twisted realm fills the space around you. Are all of these changes real? Or are they just nightmarish hallucinations?\n</li><li>You can flee, but escape is an illusion – They have found you and there’s no turning back now. Perhaps, it’s sometimes wiser to embrace the surrounding madness and stare right back into its eyes.\n</li><li>Around two-three hours of classic horror thriller gameplay.\n</li><li>Endless tension – finding a way out is no easy task.\n</li><li>Simple stealth mechanics – try to remain unnoticed when there’s no place to hide.\n</li><li>Immersive graphics and high-quality 3D sound powered by Unreal Engine 5.\n</li><li>Carefully written, directed, and voiced by professional actors.\n</li></ul>\n",
